      "writtenOn": "2018-07-13T06:59:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good point - no, I don\u0027t expect we\u0027ll have non-consecutive ones, and agree that we can easily deprecate them if necessary.\n\nIn fact, we don\u0027t need to use this somewhat complicated method and can just use a normal array in which we can easily guarantee ordering.",
      "parentUuid": "84c22986_af6966fb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 133,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 133,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "9ea0a4c27935bdf895a6fa9644b3e42fd9060c2d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
