      "writtenOn": "2018-07-12T16:50:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suggest to separate the CL that implements the infrastructure for vNVRAM from the CL(s) that add entries for specific data like board_id (and SN_BITS shall go along/after the support for storing those bits in nvram).",
